      "en": "The mixed multitude that was among them lusted exceedingly; and the children of Israel also wept again, and said, “Who will give us meat to eat?",
      "ko": "이스라엘 중에 섞여 사는 무리가 탐욕을 품으매 이스라엘 자손도 다시 울며 가로되 누가 우리에게 고기를 주어 먹게 할꼬",
      "source_text_hash": "bf0aebe971d0d12c5d4538cdff82a6c801a4609b60a6ba0a12748810ea606be7",
      "translation_text_hash": "181a1a9912bbd54dffe1c07e6f805dbeb726fb43da72cadc1ada114784c92a9e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
