      "en": "We remember the fish, which we ate in Egypt for nothing; the cucumbers, and the melons, and the leeks, and the onions, and the garlic;",
      "ko": "우리가 애굽에 있을 때에는 값 없이 생선과 외와 수박과 부추와 파와 마늘들을 먹은 것이 생각나거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "7b68c5d169851f8b573ef8d6113ee54014127ac036a619ab18e26650cbb03bbe",
      "translation_text_hash": "27750bb298d5092c44c2f3e3de923a3e3ae155fdafdacb40fd97ee5ed813d0fb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
