      "en": "You will not eat just one day, or two days, or five days, or ten days, or twenty days,",
      "ko": "하루나 이틀이나 닷새나 열흘이나 이십일만 먹을 뿐 아니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ce00a0ebc5e6e19b44df1b832fd7f641b2fbb04c1b3d54769ba62f60ef46f1aa",
